   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>A current commutated chopper is fed from a dc source of 230 V. It&rsquo;s commutating components&nbsp;are <em>L </em>= 30 &mu;H and C = 70 &mu;F. If load current of 150 A is assumed constant during the commutation&nbsp;process, find the turn-off time of main thyristor and the total commutation interval.</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>97.05 &mu;sec</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>94.65 &mu;sec</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>99.80 &mu;sec</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>103.20 &mu;sec</p>"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "A"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
