   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>A single-phase VSI fed from dc source voltage <em>V<sub>s</sub></em>. For the load <em>R </em>= 2 &Omega;, <em>X<sub>L</sub> </em>= 4 &Omega;, <em>X<sub>C</sub> </em>= 2 &Omega;, the&nbsp;shape of output voltage is</p>",
